1
00:00:00,680 --> 00:00:02,930
(Leonard:)Sheldon, you do this all the time.

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:06,940
(Leonard:)You fixate on some crazy idea
and then blow it way out of proportion.

3
00:00:07,104 --> 00:00:08,894
(Sheldon:)Name one time I've ever done that.

4
00:00:11,942 --> 00:00:14,532
(Leonard:)How about when you put GPS trackers
in your garbage...

5
00:00:14,694 --> 00:00:18,364
(Leonard:)...because you were convinced North
Korean spies were stealing your doodles.

6
00:00:19,783 --> 00:00:22,663
(Leonard:)The chicken nuggets
you were sure were human nuggets.

7
00:00:24,079 --> 00:00:27,539
(Leonard:)The strangely-shaped cloud
that was following you around town.

8
00:00:29,376 --> 00:00:30,916
(Leonard:)The time you put on my shirt...

9
00:00:31,086 --> 00:00:33,966
(Leonard:)...and were convinced
you'd started growing again.

10
00:00:35,465 --> 00:00:39,425
(Sheldon:)I said name one. You really need
to work on your listening skills.

11
00:00:42,722 --> 00:00:45,812
Penny. Penny. Penny.

12
00:00:46,309 --> 00:00:47,979
(Dr Koothrappali:)Hello.

13
00:00:48,562 --> 00:00:52,192
(Sheldon:)You need to remove that chair
from the building. It's a heaIth hazard.

14
00:00:52,357 --> 00:00:56,027
(Penny:)I took off the slipcovers, had them
dry-cleaned and fumigated the cushions.

15
00:00:56,945 --> 00:00:59,075
- Really?
- Yeah, it's cleaner than my couch.

